# The build context is the repository root, and Dockerfile.rust COPYs only Cargo.toml, Cargo.lock,
# crates/ and bin/docker-entrypoint-rust, so nothing here is needed for correctness -- it keeps the
# context small, whichever builder sends it. /target/ is the one that matters: a local cargo build
# leaves gigabytes there.
/.git/
/.github/
/target/
